00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
1/6  COMPILE
Compile the Compact circuits and generate the prover key.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
2/6  DEPLOY
Deploy the PoR contract and set the authority key.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
3/6  GENERATE PROOF
The exchange generates the proof locally - no transaction yet.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
4/6  SUBMIT
Submit the proof; the contract verifies it and anchors the root.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
5/6  READ SNAPSHOT
Regulator reads the contract address, root, prices and reserves.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
5/6  READ SNAPSHOT
It also checks liabilities, gross sums and the published flag.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:38,500
